Exact machine-registry snapshot for self-contained planning: registries/agent_operations.toml
Header: {"revision":1,"schema":"fdgr.agent_operations.v1"}
Each row is binding input to WP-000 and its owning work packages. If the source registry changes, update the affected C01/V04/Q05 beads and this snapshot before implementation; compact prose cannot weaken a row.
- OP-AGENT-OPEN-SESSION: {"authority":"read_only_negotiation","id":"OP-AGENT-OPEN-SESSION","logical_name":"fdgr.open_session","phase":"bootstrap","summary":"Negotiate protocol, lineage, grants, profiles, budgets, and continuity basis."}
- OP-AGENT-ORIENT: {"authority":"read_only","id":"OP-AGENT-ORIENT","logical_name":"fdgr.orient","phase":"orient","summary":"Return the smallest sufficient four-ledger briefing and ranked attention."}
- OP-AGENT-QUERY: {"authority":"read_only","id":"OP-AGENT-QUERY","logical_name":"fdgr.query","phase":"focus","summary":"Answer a bounded question or expand typed handles with coverage and provenance."}
- OP-AGENT-PROPOSE: {"authority":"authority_free_planning","id":"OP-AGENT-PROPOSE","logical_name":"fdgr.propose","phase":"propose","summary":"Compile an objective or next-step template into sealed candidate plans."}
- OP-AGENT-COMPARE: {"authority":"authority_free_planning","id":"OP-AGENT-COMPARE","logical_name":"fdgr.compare","phase":"compare","summary":"Compare candidates or branches on one basis and expose a Pareto frontier."}
- OP-AGENT-COMMIT: {"authority":"effectful_after_validation","id":"OP-AGENT-COMMIT","logical_name":"fdgr.commit","phase":"commit","summary":"Revalidate and commit one sealed plan, creating owned obligations."}
- OP-AGENT-WATCH: {"authority":"read_only","id":"OP-AGENT-WATCH","logical_name":"fdgr.watch","phase":"watch","summary":"Return semantic progress and terminal transitions for active work."}
- OP-AGENT-CANCEL: {"authority":"effectful_cancellation","id":"OP-AGENT-CANCEL","logical_name":"fdgr.cancel","phase":"reconcile","summary":"Request cancellation and report drain, compensation, and reconciliation."}
- OP-AGENT-EXPLAIN: {"authority":"read_only","id":"OP-AGENT-EXPLAIN","logical_name":"fdgr.explain","phase":"inspect","summary":"Traverse claims, decisions, scores, witnesses, omissions, and evidence."}
- OP-AGENT-HANDOFF: {"authority":"publication_only","id":"OP-AGENT-HANDOFF","logical_name":"fdgr.handoff","phase":"handoff","summary":"Create or resume a compact sealed authority-free continuity capsule."}
- OP-AGENT-DOCTOR: {"authority":"read_only_diagnostic","id":"OP-AGENT-DOCTOR","logical_name":"fdgr.doctor","phase":"inspect","summary":"Diagnose compatibility, custody, compute, model, policy, and qualification posture."}

